  <h3>WHAT WE DO</h3>
  <p>We have spent 5 years perfecting our proprietary “Craft Draft” process, which takes coffee and tea into the category of fine beer and wine. Craft Draft technology allows for the complete preparation of our coffee and tea in advance, imbeds flavor stability into our kegs and provides these valuable advantages:</p>
  <p>1. Food safe, unparalleled, protection of each product’s unique and extraordinary flavor profile, conveniently packaged in sanitary Sanke kegs.2. Guaranteed 120 day refrigerated with 30+ day ambient, keg stability which practically eliminates product expiration issues (that is 4 times the life of our competitor’s cold brew kegs).3. Efficient, proven dispensing system which eliminates preparation labor and costly mistakes at the serving point.4. Our products are made with the best organic and natural ingredients available, pure water, organic coffee and pure nitrogen gas. No artificial preservatives or stabilizers are used in our process.</p>
