  <h3>WHAT OTHERS SAY</h3>
  <h4>The Bona Fide Nitro Coffee and Tea Responsibility</h4>
  <p><strong>ENVIRONMENTAL SUSTAINABILITY</strong></p>
  <p>Bona Fide Nitro Coffee and Tea has sustainability embedded into its DNA. Our alternative to the typical production, packaging and solid waste steps of coffee, &amp; tea production result in a significant reduction in carbon footprint. Besides boasting a very efficient process, all of our spent coffee grounds and tea leaves are recycled to an organic farm and composting programs.</p>
  <p>Coffee is a precious commodity and should be treated as such. While industry experts are looking at how to stretch the world’s coffee production to meet a growing demand. An often overlooked but the very important statistic is that as much as 40% of brewed coffee and tea beverages in Western societies are wasted due to over-brewing and extended holding times while waiting to be served. A Bona Fide keg holds 80+ servings of perfect coffee or tea that needs little preparation. It stays fresh in the keg, ambient or cold for extended periods of time until its fully dispensed.</p>
  <p>By-the-numbers: Each stainless steel keg saves over 20 filters, 1.5 gallons of water, 1.5 pounds of roasted coffee, and 1-½ hours of labor every time it is filled. That extends to a savings of 1600 filters, 120 gallons of water, 120 pounds of coffee, and 120 hours of brewing, over its average lifetime of circulation.</p>
  <p><strong>GIVE BACK</strong></p>
  <p>Bona Fide Craft Draft Brewing Co. is pleased to partner with change-makers and nonprofit organizations who are working to make the world better at a local and global scale.</p>
  <p>In addition to practicing sustainability in all aspects of our business, we believe in going a step further and actively seeking ways to help consciousness flow.</p>
